{emailSubject}New Submission After Review - {$assignment}{/emailSubject}
<h1>New submission after review — '{$assignment}'</h1>

<p>
    User <strong>{$user}</strong> has submitted a new solution of the assignment
    <strong>'{$assignment}'</strong> which was evaluated as <strong>{$score}%</strong> correct.
</p>

<p>
    Another solution of this user has been already marked as <strong>reviewed</strong>
    and at the same time none of the solutions is marked as <strong>accepted</strong>.
    This may mean that the user is submitting a corrected solution which may be worth your attention.
</p>

{button($link, 'Open the submission')|noescape}
